flowchart LR
  Backblaze[Backblaze public daily HDD SMART archive] -->|Download archive on EC2| EC2
  subgraph AWS[Amazon Web Services account / region]
    subgraph S3[Amazon S3 project bucket]
      RAW[(raw/ - original ZIP)]
      PROC[(processed/ - parquet features)]
      RESULTS[(results/ - metrics, figures, models)]
    end
    IAM[[IAM instance role / least privilege]]
    subgraph EC2[EC2 Ubuntu CPU instance]
      LOAD[Read selected drives; validate, order, deduplicate]
      FEATURES[Past-only temporal SMART feature engineering]
      LABEL[Confirmed 7-day labels and censor filtering]
      SPLIT[Chronological split + 7-day embargo]
      MODELS[Baseline logistic regression + weighted LightGBM]
      EVAL[Threshold selected on validation; untouched test metrics]
      LOAD --> FEATURES --> LABEL --> SPLIT --> MODELS --> EVAL
    end
    CW[(CloudWatch logs, CPU, optional memory)]
  end
  EC2 -->|Upload raw ZIP| RAW
  RAW -->|Retrieve ZIP| LOAD
  LABEL -->|Upload curated features| PROC
  EVAL -->|Upload models + plots + tables| RESULTS
  IAM -. authorizes .-> RAW
  IAM -. authorizes .-> RESULTS
  EC2 -. monitor .-> CW
